{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcane Veins is a spellbinding deckbuilder where strategy, timing, and discovery are your greatest weapons. Descend into a mysterious cave, crafting a powerful deck and mastering a unique wand system to overcome cunning foes and unearth the secrets buried in the dark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build up your wand or use it now.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcane Veins utilises a wand mechanic that requires you to chain together multiple spell to get the most out of your projectiles. The more turns you use building up the wand, the stronger it gets, but your enemies won't wait for you. Your skills spells will help, but sometimes you just need to fire it off now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083120/extras/50b025b8d4b760ab31ca91f2316e5e32.poster.avif?t=1773019994\" width=998 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083120/extras/50b025b8d4b760ab31ca91f2316e5e32.webm?t=1773019994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083120/extras/50b025b8d4b760ab31ca91f2316e5e32.mp4?t=1773019994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft your deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run lets you unlock new cards and refine your arsenal. Choose your cards wisely. Synergies, combos, and smart sequencing are key to surviving the depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083120/extras/f2f4b71ff2c4120b99fc6783c869adda.poster.avif?t=1773019994\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083120/extras/f2f4b71ff2c4120b99fc6783c869adda.webm?t=1773019994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083120/extras/f2f4b71ff2c4120b99fc6783c869adda.mp4?t=1773019994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Outthink Your Foes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy has unique behaviours and weaknesses. Learn their patterns, adapt your strategy, and sometimes even turn their own abilities against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083120/extras/8e8a700c817e0ac349923b27bb0c826e.poster.avif?t=1773019994\" width=1000 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083120/extras/8e8a700c817e0ac349923b27bb0c826e.webm?t=1773019994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083120/extras/8e8a700c817e0ac349923b27bb0c826e.mp4?t=1773019994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Secrets\u00a0of the cave</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cave is layered with secrets, hidden mechanics, and subtle clues. Stay observant as what you discover in one run could be the key to victory in the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4083120?t=1773019994","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4083120?t=1773019994","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083120/2a20949846e02d200bcbff63fb4b14dab4ec83c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773019994","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083120/2a20949846e02d200bcbff63fb4b14dab4ec83c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773019994","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcane Veins is a spellbinding deckbuilder where strategy, timing, and discovery are your greatest weapons. Descend into a mysterious cave, crafting a powerful deck and mastering a unique wand system to overcome cunning foes and unearth the secrets buried in the dark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build up your wand or use it now.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcane Veins utilises a wand mechanic that requires you to chain together multiple spell to get the most out of your projectiles. The more turns you use building up the wand, the stronger it gets, but your enemies won't wait for you. Your skills spells will help, but sometimes you just need to fire it off now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083120/extras/50b025b8d4b760ab31ca91f2316e5e32.poster.avif?t=1773019994\" width=998 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083120/extras/50b025b8d4b760ab31ca91f2316e5e32.webm?t=1773019994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083120/extras/50b025b8d4b760ab31ca91f2316e5e32.mp4?t=1773019994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft your deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run lets you unlock new cards and refine your arsenal. Choose your cards wisely. Synergies, combos, and smart sequencing are key to surviving the depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083120/extras/f2f4b71ff2c4120b99fc6783c869adda.poster.avif?t=1773019994\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083120/extras/f2f4b71ff2c4120b99fc6783c869adda.webm?t=1773019994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083120/extras/f2f4b71ff2c4120b99fc6783c869adda.mp4?t=1773019994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Outthink Your Foes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy has unique behaviours and weaknesses. Learn their patterns, adapt your strategy, and sometimes even turn their own abilities against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083120/extras/8e8a700c817e0ac349923b27bb0c826e.poster.avif?t=1773019994\" width=1000 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083120/extras/8e8a700c817e0ac349923b27bb0c826e.webm?t=1773019994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083120/extras/8e8a700c817e0ac349923b27bb0c826e.mp4?t=1773019994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Secrets\u00a0of the cave</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cave is layered with secrets, hidden mechanics, and subtle clues. Stay observant as what you discover in one run could be the key to victory in the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Orquin Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083120/5e8aa086cfced279ba7ef681e5fbf6ca7ca22448/header.jpg?t=1773019994","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.a